#NEXUS

[ nesbitt2020a_fig1: Early dinosaur summary ladder, panel A, fully resolved. The shaded DINOSAURIA box spans the whole tree and is kept as the root label. 7 tips, fully resolved; 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 5 case (census 2, seed 20261215). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=7;
    TAXLABELS
        Ornithischia
        Sauropodomorpha
        Herrerasauridae
        Eoraptor
        Daemonosaurus
        Tawa
        Neotheropoda
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE nesbitt2020a_fig1 = [&R] (Ornithischia,(Sauropodomorpha,(Herrerasauridae,(Eoraptor,(Daemonosaurus,(Tawa,Neotheropoda))))))DINOSAURIA;
END;
